sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User Boundary (client-tm)
    participant M as Mirage
    participant G as Ghost Admin Boundary
    participant S as Seed Adapter

    U->>M: issue(intent)
    M->>G: execute_envelope(command_frame{command, optional_auth})
    G->>G: decode frame + validate optional auth block
    G->>S: seed.execute(operation,args)
    S-->>G: seed.result(status,stdout,stderr,exit_code)
    G-->>M: event_frame(event)
    M-->>U: report(intent phase/completion)

    alt auth missing or invalid when token required
        G-->>M: error(invalid command_frame auth)
        M-->>U: report(completion=failed)
    end

